# Copywriting & Microcopy Rules

## Forbidden AI-Words
- Banned words: "delve", "testament", "revolutionize", "tapestry", "seamless", "game-changer", "elevate", "unleash", "embark".

## Tone & Microcopy Standards
- Write like a direct, competent human.
- Button CTAs: Use plain verb + noun (e.g., "Start trial") instead of vague pitches.
- Avoid empty fluff: Replace "Empowering teams worldwide" with concrete actions (e.g., "Automate invoice syncing in 2 minutes").
- Sentence Rhythm: Mix short and medium sentences; ban the "rule of three" marketing cliché.
